// 2000 iterations that retain nothing, used to count live objects at exit.
// SX_GC_DEBUG=1 on the full seed reports 6000, three objects per iteration and
// none of them released: that runtime has an object table and refcount fields
// but no working release path in a loop. The min seed has no counter to report
// and needs none: the same loop stays inside a 4 MiB address space.
hold i = 0
while i < 2000 {
  hold t = concat("aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa", "b")
  hold i = i + 1
}
show i
